    "text": "Here, angle of incidence <math><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/333445.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 235px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Lateral shift <math><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">δ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">